372, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/rzmay2zzgub3uoyh6fav.jpg"}, {"id": 241370, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/lsylbzhgb5gjcgpgdfup.jpg"}, {"id": 241374, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/kthd0wdoqty0e3reflvn.jpg"}, {"id": 241373, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/i4gsiv9g8f4scdj55dt4.jpg"}, {"id": 241369, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ycfbtudzn5l2r9rvsdal.jpg"}, {"id": 241376, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/dm4oaea7w98yzdfbrhaz.jpg"}, {"id": 241375, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/tkdj1oaw5vtraaq0jptg.jpg"}, {"id": 241377, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/kc5nnglw66t9ckodvzji.jpg"}, {"id": 241368, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/q1unbbdb3ixapdfq8wpk.jpg"}], "slug": "nekopara-extra", "storyline": "After being taken in by Kashou and his little sister, Shigure, the young kittens, Chocola and Vanilla find it difficult to fit in. Despite the warm welcome the other Minaduki catgirls give to them, they act with trepidation as they adjust to the pace of the family.\n\nAs they slowly interact with their fellow sister catgirls, Chocola and Vanilla begin to open up more and it's here we see Kashou's kindness towards them that builds up their feelings towards him.\n\nNekopara Extra is an extra episode in the series that was part of a stretch goal from the Nekopara OVA crowdfunding campaign. The lovable catgirls, Chocola and Vanilla, are back and this time the story focuses on their first arrival at the Minazuki household before the events of Nekopara Vol. 1.", "summary": "About half a year before the opening of the patisserie, La Soleil where the catgirls work with Kashou.\nBack when Chocola and Vanilla were still kittens when they first arrived at the Minaduki household and before they opened up to the other catgirls.\nIt's then that they gradually began to call Kashou \"master\", experienced their first Christmas, and shared a promise with Kashou.\nThis is an extra episode as part of a stretch goal from the Nekopara OVA crowdfunding campaign!", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nekopara-extra", "collections": [{"id": 2576, "name": "Nekopara"}]}